{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "91acc56c-1473-89ea-aae8-d58fe9617130",
  "created_at": "2026-03-03T16:08:01-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Deirdre Kearney",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:00:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:00:40-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi hon, Deirdre Kearney. I got a water and sewer bill with a late fee on it and I'm telling you, that check went out on time. I mailed it weeks ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:00:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, let's take a look. What's the service address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:01:00-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "362 Farewell Street, in the North End. I'm the landlord, it's a rental. I pay the bill, the tenants don't."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:01:10-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Bear with me a second while I pull that up. [pause] Okay, I see the account at 362 Farewell. And it's showing a late charge on the most recent bill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:01:25-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, that's the one. Hang on hon, I'm gonna put you on speaker, I'm trying to hold the bill and the phone and my reading glasses. Can you hear me okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:01:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, I can hear you fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:01:44-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh that's better, I can hear you better too. Anyway, the check was written, uh, the first week of February, I'd have to look at the stub, and I put it in the mailbox myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:02:00-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So what I'm seeing is that the payment posted after the due date. The date we received it is what counts, not the date it was mailed. Usually the postmark helps if there's a dispute, but I can't see that from here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:02:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it got here late. That's the post office, not me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:02:26-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It could be. Mail does slow down sometimes. Do you have the check number, or did the check clear through your bank yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:02:37-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it cleared, I looked at it online. Cleared on the, uh, [pause] the eleventh. So it was there a few days before that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:02:48-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. That's helpful. What I can do is make a note on the account that you're disputing the late fee, with the date you mailed it and the date it cleared. Then it goes to the billing supervisor to review. I can't remove it myself from this desk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:03:10-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's fine. Put that down. Mailed first week of February, cleared the eleventh."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:03:17-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, writing that in now. Do you want the late fee held off the next bill while they look at it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:03:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can you do that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:03:31-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can flag it in the note so it's marked as under review. Whether it's adjusted is up to the supervisor, but they'll see your request."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:03:43-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good enough. Now, while I got you, I need a copy of the bill. The paper one's got coffee on it, hon, it's a mess. Can you email me a duplicate?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:03:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, we can do that. What email address would you like it sent to?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:04:05-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's, uh, deirdre dot kearney rentals at, um, a mail dot com. Wait, no. Hold on. Let me say it slower. D-E-I-R-D-R-E, dot, K-E-A-R-N-E-Y, then rentals, all one word, at a mail dot com."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:04:21-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, let me read that back. Deirdre dot Kearney rentals, at a mail dot com. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:04:30-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Perfect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:04:32-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. I'll send the duplicate of the current bill with the late charge showing, so the supervisor and you are looking at the same thing. It should come through in a little while, today or tomorrow morning at the latest."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:04:50-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. And, okay, here's the other thing. I wanna just pay this thing and be done with it so it doesn't get worse. Can I pay it online tonight? I know you're closed, it's after four, almost. I mean once City Hall's shut, is there a way?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:05:12-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, you can. There's an online payment option on the city website, it's open around the clock. You'd need your account number, which is on the bill, and then you can pay from a bank account or a card."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:05:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And that works at night, like nine, ten o'clock?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:05:35-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, any time. The only thing is, if you pay late in the evening it may show up as received the next business day, depending on how it processes. So if you're close to a due date, that matters."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:05:53-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm not close, I'm already past, so a day won't kill me. Is there a drop box too, in case I do a check again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:06:05-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a payment drop box at City Hall. You can leave a check in there outside of hours. Just put your account number on the check or the stub."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:06:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I might just do the online, honestly. After what the mail did to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:06:27-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's probably the quickest. And should I mention the late fee in the note, so you can pay the base amount and hold the fee while it's reviewed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:06:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm. Is that okay to do? I don't wanna get another notice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:06:46-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The system will take whatever amount you enter. I'd pay the full charges that aren't in dispute, and the note will show that the fee is under review. That should cover you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:07:01-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So I pay everything but the late fee, and your note says I'm disputing it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:07:09-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. The duplicate bill will break out the late charge as a separate line, so you'll see the number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:07:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. And how long till somebody gets back to me on the dispute?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:07:25-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A week or so, usually. If you haven't heard anything by then, call back and give your address and mention the note. Do you want to leave a callback number in case the supervisor has questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:07:42-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0182."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:07:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0182. Got it, that's in the note too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:07:48-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Okay hon, that's everything. Thanks, Tony, you were a big help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:07:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, Deirdre. Have a good evening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T16:07:58-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, bye now."
    }
  ],
